<h2>4. PATH 2: model-type = "huggingface"</h2>
<h3>How It Works</h3>
<p>Model artifacts stored in S3 are pulled to an AEX worker node (ECS) and loaded into GPU memory for inference.</p>
<h3>Feasibility Assessment</h3>
<table>
<tr><th>Requirement</th><th>Current AEX Limit</th><th>Gemma 4 31B Needs</th><th>Status</th></tr>
<tr><td>Worker Ephemeral Storage</td><td>20 GiB (default)</td><td>65+ GB</td><td class="fail">FAILS - model cannot fit</td></tr>
<tr><td>ECR Image Layer Size</td><td>52 GB max per layer</td><td>65 GB model</td><td class="fail">FAILS - exceeds limit</td></tr>
<tr><td>GPU Support (Fargate)</td><td>No GPU available</td><td>71 GB VRAM (FP16)</td><td class="fail">FAILS - no GPU on Fargate</td></tr>
<tr><td>S3 Download Time</td><td>Unknown timeout</td><td>~5-10 min for 65 GB</td><td class="warn">RISK</td></tr>
<tr><td>Cold Start</td><td>Unknown health check timeout</td><td>2-5 minutes for model load</td><td class="warn">RISK</td></tr>
</table>

<h3>Problems Blocking This Path</h3>
<table>
<tr><th>#</th><th>Problem</th><th>Detail</th><th>Severity</th></tr>
<tr><td>1</td><td class="fail">Worker ephemeral storage = 20 GiB</td><td>Model is 65 GB. Cannot physically fit on the worker. Would need 100+ GiB storage.</td><td>CRITICAL</td></tr>
<tr><td>2</td><td class="fail">ECR image layer limit = 52 GB</td><td>Cannot bake the 65 GB model into the container image.</td><td>CRITICAL</td></tr>
<tr><td>3</td><td class="fail">ECS Fargate has no GPU</td><td>Model requires 71 GB of GPU VRAM. Fargate does not support GPUs at all.</td><td>CRITICAL</td></tr>
<tr><td>4</td><td class="fail">No JFrog to S3 transfer mechanism</td><td>Cannot get the model from Artifactory into the S3 bucket efficiently.</td><td>CRITICAL</td></tr>
<tr><td>5</td><td class="warn">No tensor parallelism support</td><td>Cannot split model across multiple GPUs (TP=2 or TP=4 needed for most instances).</td><td>HIGH</td></tr>
<tr><td>6</td><td class="warn">Cold start exceeds health check</td><td>Model loading takes 2-5 minutes. Health checks likely timeout before model is ready.</td><td>MEDIUM</td></tr>
</table>

