<tr><td>6</td><td>65 GB tar.gz packaging impractical</td><td>sagemaker</td><td>Default expects model.tar.gz</td><td>Skip tar.gz or stream directly from S3</td><td class="warn">P1 - HIGH</td></tr>
<tr><td>7</td><td>No GPU instance type selection in workflow</td><td>sagemaker</td><td>deploy-on-gpu = true/false only</td><td>Selectable: ml.p4d.24xlarge, ml.g5.12xlarge, etc.</td><td class="warn">P1 - HIGH</td></tr>
