<tr><td>9</td><td>No tensor parallelism configuration</td><td>huggingface, sagemaker</td><td>Not configurable</td><td>TP=1,2,4,8 configurable</td><td class="warn">P2 - MEDIUM</td></tr>
<tr><td>10</td><td>Cold start exceeds health check timeout</td><td>huggingface, sagemaker</td><td>Unknown (likely &lt; 5 min)</td><td>10-15 minutes for 65 GB model loading</td><td class="warn">P2 - MEDIUM</td></tr>
